OL,3,GNEWSA'Selfish' driver who hit cyclist
OL,4,Anot a murderer, jury told
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains
OL,7,Fdistressing content
OL,9,FA motorist who dragged a cyclist
OL,10,Ftrapped under his car for more than a
OL,11,Fmile was responsible for his death, but
OL,12,Fthat did not make him a murderer, a
OL,13,Fcourt has heard.
OL,15,FSimon Richardson, 35, is on trial at
OL,16,FManchester Minshull Street Crown Court
OL,17,Faccused of the murder of head teacher
OL,18,FMichael Mullins, 56, who was knocked
OL,19,Foff his bike as he travelled home from
OL,20,FStretford Grammar School in Manchester.
